e occupation in several points of the archaeological zone, so the sources disagree and do not fix -500 as the first occupation.", "round": 1, "verdict": "unclear"}, "owner": {"at": "2026-10-25T07:49:50+00:00", "decision": "D69", "reason": "owner 2026-10-25 (D69): write the researcher''s value with its found quote for a cell the re-check held as unclear"}}]'::jsonb),
